// Embeds the type library in the DLL as resource 1.
//
// This is what makes the server a single file to deploy: RegisterTypeLib reads the
// .tlb back out of the module, a client that binds early finds it there, and the
// IDispatch implementation can load it even with nothing in the registry (see the
// LoadTypeLibEx fallback in keynub_com.cpp) — which is what registration-free COM
// activation needs.
//
// Generated from keynub_com.rc.in; the path is substituted by the native build because MIDL
// writes the .tlb into the build tree, not next to this file.
1 TYPELIB "@KEYNUB_TLB_PATH@"
